<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f2ef" class="bg">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#f4f2ef;opacity:0">On 19 Oct 2026, 00:00 UTC, GitHub was disconnected from your Nimbus account, so it can no longer be used to sign in.&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;</div>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" bgcolor="#f4f2ef" class="bg" style="background:#f4f2ef"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:40px 12px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" style="width:100%;max-width:600px">
<tr><td bgcolor="#201d1a" class="px" style="background:#201d1a;border-radius:28px 28px 0 0;padding:32px 40px 36px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="middle"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="28" height="28" bgcolor="#ff6b3d" style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff6b3d;font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td><td valign="middle" style="padding-left:10px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;font-weight:bold;color:#f4f2ef;letter-spacing:-0.3px">nimbus</td></tr></table>
<h1 style="margin:28px 0 0 0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:36px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:bold;color:#f4f2ef;letter-spacing:-0.5px">GitHub disconnected</h1></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#fffefc" class="card px" style="background:#fffefc;border-radius:0 0 28px 28px;padding:36px 40px 40px">
<p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#6b6763">On 19 Oct 2026, 00:00 UTC, GitHub was disconnected from your Nimbus account, so it can no longer be used to sign in.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin:0 0 24px 0"><tr><td class="tile muted" bgcolor="#f4f2ef" style="padding:14px 20px;border-radius:16px;background:#f4f2ef;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#6b6763">Not you, or want it back? Review your sign-in methods on the Security page.</td></tr></table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#ff6b3d" style="border-radius:999px;background:#ff6b3d"><a href="https://example.dev/settings/security" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#201d1a;text-decoration:none">Review sign-in methods</a></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="px foot" style="padding:24px 40px 0 40px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#878381">You get this email whenever a way to sign in is added to or removed from your Nimbus account.</td></tr>
