, text=On 19 Oct 2026, 00:00 UTC, GitHub was disconnected from your Nimbus account, so it can no longer be used to sign in.

Not you, or want it back? Review your sign-in methods on the Security page.
https://example.dev/settings/security

You get this email whenever a way to sign in is added to or removed from your Nimbus account.]